 DE REGALO PREMIUM MATEBREAK! 🤟🧉</strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">NO PUEDE SER TODO COLOR DE ROSAS: Es tan exclusivo que<strong> demoramos de 10 a 12 dias</strong> una vez efectuada la compra, en grabarlo y enviartelo.</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">ACLARACIÓN: El diseño de las guardas varia en ABSTRACTA y PAMPA, enviamos según disponibilidad</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Hace tu pedido hoy mismo y aprovecha nuestros <strong>envíos a todo el país </strong>o la opción de <strong>retirar gratis</strong> por TANDIL o MAR DEL PLATA.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n                        ","tipo":"combo","precio":97800,"precio_original":115000,"precio_transferencia":83130,"descuento":14.957,"moneda":"ARS","cuotas":{"Pagos Personalizados":{"1":{"installment_value":97800,"installment_value_cents":9780000,"interest":0,"total_value":97800,"without_interests":true,"collector_is_third_party":false}},"Mercado Pago":{"1":{"installment_value":97800,"installment_value_cents":9780000,"interest":0,"total_value":97800,"without_interests":true,"collector_is_third_party":false},"2":{"installment_value":48900,"installment_value_cents":4890000,"interest":0,"total_value":97800,"without_interests":true,"collector_is_third_party":false},"3":{"installment_value":32600,"installment_value_cents":3260000,"interest":0,"total_value":97800,"without_interests":true,"collector_is_third_party":false},"6":{"installment_value":22177.78,"installment_value_cents":2217778,"interest":0.3606,"total_value":133066.68,"without_interests":false,"collector_is_third_party":false},"9":{"installment_value":16494.51,"installment_value_cents":1649451,"interest":0.5179,"total_value":148450.62,"without_interests":false,"collector_is_third_party":false},"12":{"installment_value":13405.94,"installment_value_cents":1340594,"interest":0.6449,"total_value":160871.22,"without_interests":false,"collector_is_third_party":false},"18":{"installment_value":10890.03,"installment_value_cents":1089003,"interest":1.0043,"total_val